{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"携帯の画面がね、バキバキなの！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうね！すごいの！\nよく画面バキバキのまま携帯使ってる人\nいるけど、\nいまそういう人になってる！私！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや！でもね！\nビクビクしながら携帯の使ってるの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だって次落としたら、\nたぶん画面と本体が分裂するよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こわすぎるこわい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなことになったら、ブログ書けなくなるし\n社会とシャットダウンされるもん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"携帯ってこわい( ˘ｰωｰ˘ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー、画面がバリバリで\nよく見えなくて打ち間違えありそう。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/25/0142555/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/25/0142555/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バームクーヘン\n8個くらい食べた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"茶色い甘いところが1番好き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/25/0142555/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は、おに魂に\nひなちまとゲスト出演します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"20時から23時までおに魂やってますが、\nたぶん22時過ぎくらいから\n出るんじゃないかなーと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、わかったらいうね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！あしたこそメールします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんなさい( ˘ｰωｰ˘ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週もたくさんいろいろお仕事があるので\n楽しんでがんばります！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏休み中の皆さんは\n今後の予定は決まってるのかなー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんなことするのか気になる！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も家族でおでかけしたいー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、おやすみなさい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/25/0142555/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/25/0142555/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/25/0142555/0002.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}